WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:17.428
Bobby was dribbling a basketball on the blacktop.

2
00:00:17.429 --> 00:00:21.969
He was pretending to be on the Eagles, the high school's team.

3
00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:25.918
Miss Shelly was getting ready to start an activity.

4
00:00:25.919 --> 00:00:29.282
"It'd better be fun," Bobby thought.

5
00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:32.674
He didn't want to stop playing basketball.

6
00:00:32.675 --> 00:00:36.286
Miss Shelly had a big box of chalk and a ball.

7
00:00:36.287 --> 00:00:40.297
She blew her whistle.

8
00:00:40.298 --> 00:00:45.408
"Let's gather on the blacktop!" she called.

9
00:00:45.409 --> 00:00:49.921
"I want to be on Izzie's team!" Nina cried.

10
00:00:49.922 --> 00:00:54.589
"You don't even know what we're doing yet," Bobby said.

11
00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:56.847
"We're going to play a game.

12
00:00:56.848 --> 00:01:00.644
It's called Four Square," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:01:00.645 --> 00:01:03.391
Bobby knew Four Square.

14
00:01:03.392 --> 00:01:05.730
His sisters played it.

15
00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:09.261
Kids Central was going to be fun today.

16
00:01:09.262 --> 00:01:14.481
"Who has played Four Square before?" Miss Shelly asked.

17
00:01:14.482 --> 00:01:18.279
Only Bobby raised his hand.

18
00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:22.190
"I'm going to be the best!" he thought.

19
00:01:22.191 --> 00:01:27.690
"Bobby, would you draw a Four Square board for us?" Miss Shelly asked.

20
00:01:27.691 --> 00:01:29.883
She held out the chalk.

21
00:01:29.884 --> 00:01:36.072
Bobby drew a large square and then divided it into four smaller squares.

22
00:01:36.073 --> 00:01:44.868
He numbered them 1, 2, 3, 4.

23
00:01:44.869 --> 00:01:51.373
"I start by passing the ball to Bobby," explained Miss Shelly.

24
00:01:51.374 --> 00:01:58.058
"The ball must bounce once in my square and then go into Bobby's.

25
00:01:58.059 --> 00:02:03.158
If the ball lands on any line, I am out.

26
00:02:03.159 --> 00:02:09.442
Bobby must hit the ball with his hands and bounce the ball to another square.

27
00:02:09.443 --> 00:02:14.401
If he doesn't, he is out.

28
00:02:14.402 --> 00:02:21.534
If the ball goes out of the big square without bouncing in any square, he is out.

29
00:02:21.535 --> 00:02:26.018
If he catches the ball, he is out.

30
00:02:26.019 --> 00:02:29.434
If Bobby is out, he will go to square 1.

31
00:02:29.435 --> 00:02:35.548
The person in square 1 will move to square 2, and so on.

32
00:02:35.549 --> 00:02:38.589
We will play for five minutes.

33
00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:44.788
Whoever is in square 4 at the end wins!

34
00:02:44.789 --> 00:02:57.464
Bobby, you're in square 1. Izzie, square 2. Jason, 3. Nina, 4."

35
00:02:57.465 --> 00:03:00.705
"That's not fair!" Bobby cried.

36
00:03:00.706 --> 00:03:03.412
"I'm going to lose!"

37
00:03:03.413 --> 00:03:07.991
"It's ABC order, Bobby," Miss Shelly replied.

38
00:03:07.992 --> 00:03:09.679
"Square 4 starts.

39
00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:12.581
Here you go, Nina!"

40
00:03:12.582 --> 00:03:17.375
"Ready?" Nina said. Everyone nodded.

41
00:03:17.376 --> 00:03:20.697
She bounced the ball to Jason in square 3.

42
00:03:20.698 --> 00:03:23.106
Jason bounced the ball to Izzie.

43
00:03:23.107 --> 00:03:25.586
Izzie bounced the ball to Bobby.

44
00:03:25.587 --> 00:03:28.465
Bobby bounced the ball back to Izzie.

45
00:03:28.466 --> 00:03:30.883
But she missed!

46
00:03:30.884 --> 00:03:37.289
"You're out!" Bobby shouted.

47
00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:41.881
"Bobby, there's no need to yell," Miss Shelly warned.

48
00:03:41.882 --> 00:03:45.158
"Nina, go ahead and start again."

49
00:03:45.159 --> 00:03:58.053
Nina bounced the ball to Jason.

50
00:03:58.054 --> 00:04:01.973
"Ten seconds left," Miss Shelly called.

51
00:04:01.974 --> 00:04:06.099
Bobby panicked. He had to get Nina out to win.

52
00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.876
But no one was passing him the ball!

53
00:04:08.877 --> 00:04:16.030
"Three, two, one. Game over," Miss Shelly said.

54
00:04:16.031 --> 00:04:19.808
"No!" Bobby groaned.

55
00:04:19.809 --> 00:04:23.936
"Hooray, I win!" Nina cried.

56
00:04:23.937 --> 00:04:26.508
"Four Square is fun."

57
00:04:26.509 --> 00:04:29.831
"Yay, Nina," Izzie cheered.

58
00:04:29.832 --> 00:04:38.077
"Four Square is no fair," Bobby said, frowning.

59
00:04:38.078 --> 00:04:44.964
"Four Square is good practice for basketball, isn't it?" Miss Shelly said.

60
00:04:44.965 --> 00:04:46.502
Bobby paused.

61
00:04:46.503 --> 00:04:49.409
"Yeah, I guess so.

62
00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:52.207
It's good practice for passing.

63
00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:59.939
Hey, Miss Shelly, when can we play again?"

64
00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:10.876
[caption_out@
